        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-12-20/pdf/2019-27678.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 5. General Provisions. (a) This order shall be implemented consistent \nwith applicable law and subject to the availability of appropriations."
    },
