      },
      "text": "(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:58 Dec 19, 2019 Jkt 250001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\20DEE0.SGM 20DEE0jbell on DSKJLSW7X2PROD with EXECORD\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n69984 Federal Register / Vol. 84, No. 245 / Friday, December 20, 2019 / Presidential Documents"
    },
